<title>POLAND: Rolimpex plans no dividend for 1996.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex plans no dividend for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Rolimpex SA plans to pay no dividend for 1996 and to put nearly all of its 10.3-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rolimpex said 10 million zlotys would go to reserves, the rest to help make up losses from previous years.</p>
<p>Shareholders vote on the proposal on June 27.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
